\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aurea corona beatissime virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Awe Maria ... (Lc 1,28). Hec est regina virginum, que coronata est corona XII stellarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magnificat anima mea dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Maria, summum celi gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Zwischen die Gebetsabschnitte die rubrizierten Verse des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Magnificat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eingeschoben. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versiculus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gloria et honore coronasti matrem tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Omnipotens et misericors deus, de cuius munere venit, ut tibi a fidelibus tuis digne et laudabiliter serviatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi eius vera sunt gaudia per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
