\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Horae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  de sancto spiritu. (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto spiritu hore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In unitate sancti spiritus benedicat nos pater et filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eius aput te intercessionibus adiuvemur per eundem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  AH 50, Nr 144. Ed.: Lund\u233 \'e9n, Officium parvum, Bd 2, S. 184-208. Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes de sancto spiritu}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio de sancto spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O dulcis consolator et pius illuminator, sancte spiritus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 3 Gebete, die \u252 \'fcbrigen Initien im Register. Auch Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Uppsala, UB, C\~455}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Uppsala 5, S. 157. Darunter: (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 War h\u230 \'e6rra sagdhe sancte Mechtilde for then wanhedhir mik g\u248 \'f8rs om fastogangin l\u230 \'e6s mic the antiphonam CCCL sinnom\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tibi laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Druck: Geete, B\u246 \'f6ner, S. VIII.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

