\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Mechthild [von Hackeborn}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Drei Ave}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancta M\u230 \'e6ktildir badh til iomfru Maria j blandh andra sina b\u248 \'f8ner at hon skuldhe w\u230 \'e6rdhogas hona ey \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  forlata i d\u248 \'f8dzsins tima. Hon swaradhe th\u230 \'e6t wil iak wisselika g\u248 \'f8ra \u230 \'e6n thre Aue Maria skalt thu daghlika l\u230 \'e6sa mik. J the f\u248 \'f8rsta tha sigh swa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Jak bidhir thik min s\u248 \'f8tasta iomfru Maria at swa som gudh fadhir m\u230 \'e6dh sinne alzwallogasta makt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 J the tridhio sigh swa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. [J]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ac bidhir thik mildasta jomfru Maria for th\u230 \'e6n k\u230 \'e6rlekx s\u248 \'f8tman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (supr. l.: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 th\u230 \'e6n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 th\u230 \'e6lghe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ande\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aff k\u230 \'e6rleksens gafua. Amen. Aue Maria.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpt aus: Liber specialis gratiae, Buch 1, Kap. 86 (vgl. pars 1, cap. 47 des lat. Originals). Ed.: Hel. Mechtilds uppenbarelser (Liber spiritualis gratiae) \u246 \'f6fversatta fr\u229 \'e5n latinet \u229 \'e5r 1469 af J\u246 \'f6ns Budde. Efter gamla handskrifter utg. af Robert Geete (SFSS 32), Stockholm 1899, S. 390-391; abgedruckt: Britta Olrik Frederiksen, En dansk Mechtild-tradition? En unders\u248 \'f8gelse af nogle gammeldanske b\u248 \'f8nner, Kopenhagen 1984, S. 142f., s. ebd., S. 169-171 Bilag 1: Lesarten a im Variantenapparat aus dieser Hs.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

