\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Franciscus Petrarca}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Psalmi paenitentiales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egregij doctoris eximij et famosissimi poete laureati domini Francisci Petrarche septem psalmi penitenciales, quos super miseriis propriis dictavit, incipiunt feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Heu mihi misero, quia iratum adversum me constitui redemptorem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Druck: P\u233 \'e9trarque: Les psaumes p\u233 \'e9nitentiaux. Publi\u233 \'e9s d\rquote apr\u232 \'e8s le manuscrit de la Biblioth\u232 \'e8que de Lucerne par Henry Cochin, Paris 1929, S. 36-80; f\u252 \'fcr Psalm 1, 4 und 6 auch: Francesco Petrarca: Rime, trionfi e poesie latine. A cura di Ferdinando Neri, Guido Martellotti [u.a.] (La letteratura italiana. Storia e testi 6), Mailand - Neapel 1951, S. 836-844 u. 866. Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr 2323. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr 2331. Bertalot, Initia II/1, Nr 8703.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

