ficium, S. 182. Vgl. f\u252 \'fcr die \u252 \'fcbrigen Gebete des Zyklus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Theol. lat. oct. 68}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 bis\~r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Orationes 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Theol. lat. oct. 75}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Oratio 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
