\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Statuta provincialis concilii Salisburgensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  [anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1300]. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Declaraciones domini {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Chunradi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  archyepiscopi Saltzburgensis de consilio suffraganeorum suorum que incipit super kadhedram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super singulis articulis predicte constitucionis domini Bonifacii pape viii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ad observacionem salubris constitucionis in Christo sanctissimi patris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonifacii pape viii nec non ad tranquillum et quietum statum prelatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 parrochialium ecclesiarum ex una et predicatorum ac minorum ordinum fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex altera videtur expedire circa articulum predicacionis. Primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Indulgencia, que ab uno vel pluribus episcopis in ecclesiarum dedicacionibus vel aliis quibuscumque casibus conceduntur, vires non obtinent, si statutum excesserint concilij generalis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt declaraciones domini Chunradi archyepiscopi Salitzburgensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Vgl. Johann Friedrich Schannat, Joseph Hartzheim, Concilia Germaniae, Bd 4, K\u246 \'f6ln 1761 (Ndr. Aalen 1970), S. 95; H\u252 \'fcbner, Provinzialsynoden, aaO., S. 220; Carl Joseph Hefele, Histoire des conciles d\rquote apr\u232 \'e8s les documents originaux. Nouv. trad. fran\u231 \'e7. corr. et augm. par H[enri] Leclercq, Bd VI/1.2, Paris 1914-15 (Ndr. Hildesheim - New York 1973), S. 464.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

