\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Alexander Halensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Quaestiones abbreviatae super libros Sententiarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I-IV]. (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Queritur que sit differencia inter essenciam, substanciam, ypostasim et personam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo: Essentia dicit ipsam naturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (2.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item quomodo differenter sunt hec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [principia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rerum in naturis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (3.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item si verbum mediante anima cordi sit coniunctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (4.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sacramentis. Si circumcisio tollebat culpam et penam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ideo tenentur plus frequentare.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Stegm\u252 \'fcller RS Nr 61. Mohan, Initia, S. 314*. - 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  s.o.
