\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1. (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Nota}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 de corpore Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sunt autem cause tres, quare corpus Christi in specie et forma panis datur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et non in specie vini sanguis laicis. Prima causa:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Angeschlossen: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Walther, Initia 8487. 20340.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 2. (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ecl 4,7-12. Ecl 5,3.4. Ecl 6,3.4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ier 8,7}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Tb 3,7-9.15-17}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Nach Verweisung: (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tb 3,18-23.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 3. (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In evangelium Iohannis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], tract. 12, pars 11, Exzerpt. Ed.: CC 36, S. 126f. Z. 4-21. CPL Nr 278.}

