\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtrag: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Dilige dulciter et prudenter fortiter ut non / Illectus vel deceptus pressusve recedas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / ...-... / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Velle bonum firme non per se sufficiens est.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  24 Verse.
