\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Eingeschoben, von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermones}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  selecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], de sanctis et in synodo. (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Duo sermones de BMV. \u220 \'dcberschrift, jeweils nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De beata virgine.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In principio ... (Gn 1,1). Privilegiorum alia pertinent ad generationem sive vite ingressum, alia ad conversationem sive vite progressum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , alia ad mortem sive vite egressum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . nach Verweisungen: 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gloriosa dicta sunt de te civitas dei (Ps 86,3), id est virgo Maria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hec est illa civitas in qua natus est homo scilicet filius dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . nach Verweisung: 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In synodo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 [V]os estis genus ... (I Pt 2,9). Triplex est electio: scilicet electio, subelectio, preelectio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In commemoratione omnium fidelium defunctorum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Miseremini mei ... (Iob 19,21). Bis dicit Miseremini, quia inimici bis dixerunt Crucifige, crucifige}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; angef\u252 \'fcgt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Lv 21,10.13-14}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De BMV. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gracia plena (Lc 1,28) quantum ad te, dominus tecum quantum ad deum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , benedicta tu in mulieribus quantum ad proximum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

