\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sammlung von Predigtmaterialien\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \u220 \'dcberschrift, nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In conversione sancti Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Vocabis me ... (Iob 14,15). Iam cessaverat legalis observantia, mater Synagoga, iam sepulta erat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ambrosius Autpertus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Expositio in Apocalypsin}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], lib. 7, Exzerpt. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Ed.: CCCM 27 A, S. 623 Z. 113 - S. 624 Z. 136. (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermones] in purificatione BMV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De purificacione Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 odie templi dominum in templum virgo mater inducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gratias redemptori nostro etc. Celebrata paulo ante nativitate, circumcisione, apparicione, hodie oblacionis dies illuxit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Sermo I und II, Exzerpte. (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Purificacionis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Purificacionem beate virginis etc. Oblatio ista, fratres, satis delicata videtur, ubi tantum sistitur domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Sermo III, Exzerpt. Druck: PL 183, Sp. 365-372. Ed.: Opera. Rec. J. Leclercq, H. Rochais, Bd 4, Rom 1966, S. 334-344. Vgl. Schneyer 1, S. 447 Nr 91-93. Dazwischengeschoben: Predigtentw\u252 \'fcrfe: (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de sancto Paulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Marie Magdalene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Notae: (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de fide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de spe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de effectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [spei]\u8249 \'8b. Bibelstellen und Autorit\u228 \'e4ten: (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) u.a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

