\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermones}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  selecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], de tempore. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non vos me elegisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 15,16). Thema nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt; vgl. unten 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Folgt: Schneyer 4, S. 874 Nr 56 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Praepositinus de Cremona}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Cum sublevasset ... (Io 6,5). Quinque enim sunt, que faciunt cibum materialem dulcem et delectabilem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De adventu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 At ubi venit ... (Gal 4,4). Dicitur autem plenitudo temporis quando Christus natus est propter triplicem repletionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : ventris, mentis, legis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 2. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Petrus Lombardus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sententiarum libri quattuor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. 3, dist. 23, cap. 4, Exzerpt. Ed. cit., Bd 2, S. 143 Z. 13 - S. 144 Z. 4.
