\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sermones selecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], de tempore, de sanctis et de communi sanctorum. (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Inventa est Abisag Sunamitis et calefecit regem David, rex autem non cognovit eam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut legitur in libro regum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . nach Verweisungen: 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (2.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Egredietur virga ... (Is 11,1). Jesse interpretatur incendium amoris de qua virga ista, id est beata virgo Maria, est egressa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (3.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Non vos me elegisti[s] ... (Io 15,16). A quo dictum est scitis, scilicet a domino et eius discipulis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Druck: PL 171, Sp. 761-765 (mit Abweichungen von dieser Hs). Vgl. Schneyer 4, S. 643 Nr 94 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Es folgen 16 Predigten, Initien im Register.}

