\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermones breves de sanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Andreas - Catharina. In der Regel 2 kurze Predigten bzw. Dispositionen f\u252 \'fcr jedes Fest, nur in wenigen F\u228 \'e4llen weiter ausgef\u252 \'fchrt. (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Vir obediens ... (Prv 21,28). In hiis verbis commendatur beatus Andreas dupliciter, scilicet racio[ne] termini inicialis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (2.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ascendam in palmam ... (Ct 7,8). Fructus quos apprehendit beatus Andreas in palma crucis sunt v}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , videlicet domini assimilacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (73.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancte Katerine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Purpura et bissus ... (Prv 31,22). In hiis verbis innuitur circa beatam Katherinam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (74.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item alius sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Veni in ortum ... (Ct 5,1). Katherina soror Christi dicitur propter hereditatis participacionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Nachweisbar: Schneyer 7, S. 629 Nr 220 (zu 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ebd., S. 631 Nr 248 (zu 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ebd., S. 639 Nr 394 (zu 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Bemerkenswerte Feste: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In translacione beati Dominici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (24.5.), \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo beati Dominici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (5.8.), \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De beato Francisco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (4.10.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

