\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Varia theologica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 2 Themata mit wenigen Stichworten. Dann: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Duo {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 sermones universitatis Parisiensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Schneyer 6, S. 175 Nr 17, S. 176 Nr 22. (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sermo]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , de communi sanctorum. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ioachim summus pontifex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Idt 15,9-11). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ioachim, qui preparatus domino interpretatur, est Christus Iesus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui venit de celesti Ierusalem cum universis prespiteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \u220 \'dcberschrift, nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Johanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Bapt.]. Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Servus meus es ... (Is 49,3). In verbis propositis thematis nota quinque circa nativitatem naturalem Iohannis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel spiritualem cuiuslibet fratris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Effectus passionis Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Pacificat, mundat, redimit, dat vivere, ditat, ... Pacificat inter celestia et terrestria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quo complacuit omnem deitatis plenitudinem inhabitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Premia reddit, unde latroni penitenti dictum est: hodie mecum eris in paradyso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 23,34)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u196 \'c4hnlicher Text in Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, W 151}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. K\u246 \'f6ln 4, S. 72.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

