\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Summa de vitiis et de virtutibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpte. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De fide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Fide agnoscimus suppremum (!) finem, summum bonum esse bonum se communicans}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ex qua cognitione due affectiones nascuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In malogranatis sanctorum ordinata societas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Unter Auslassung gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferer Partien meist w\u246 \'f6rtliche Exzerpte fortlaufend aus allen Teilen beider Werke. Textabfolge: (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [Summa de virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Secunda pars principalis. Aus: tract. I; tract. II, cap. 1. 3-4. 30; tract. III, cap. 1. 3-5; tract. IV, cap. 1-10. 14-18. (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tertia pars principalis. Aus: tract. I, cap. 1-2; tract. II, cap. 2-3. 5; tract. III, cap. 1-7. 10-13; tract. IV, pars 2-6; tract. V, pars 1. 3-7. 10. 11. 13-16. (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quarta pars principalis. Aus: pars 2-12. (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quinta pars principalis. Aus: pars 1-12. (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prima pars principalis. Aus: cap. 1-10. (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Summa de vitiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Aus: tract. II, pars 1-2. 4; tract. III, pars 1-5; tract. IV, pars 1-2. 4-5; tract. V, pars 1-4; tract. VI, pars 2-3; tract. VII, pars 1-3; tract. VIII, pars 1. 3; tract. IX, pars 1-3. (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Summa de virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Aus: Secunda pars principalis, tract. III, cap. 5. Korrekte Textfolge nach Vertauschung zweier Doppelbll: 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (durch Verweisungszeichen angezeigt) bzw. 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Drucke (u.a.): Hain *12383 / GW 12049 = VB 393 (Summa de virtutibus); Hain *12384 / GW 12052 = VB 394 (Summa de vitiis); verglichen mit dem Druck: Guilielmi Peraldi [...] Summae virtutum ac vitiorum tomus I et II [...] studio et opera Rodolphi Clutii. K\u246 \'f6ln 1614. Zum Autor u. zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Dondaine, Peyraut, bes. S. 184-197; Kaeppeli, Scriptores OP, Nr 1622 A u. B; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr 1628. 5601.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge am unteren Rand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Me pro me, dominum pro me, dominum quoque pro se}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  / Et me pro domino, sic diligo non bene primo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7  Esto libens, hilaris, humilis, cita, fervida, simplex}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  / Et perseverans monachi subiectio veri.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

