\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sammlung von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Predigtmaterialien}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden. (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Systematisch gegliederte Predigtentw\u252 \'fcrfe. (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermones}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  selecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], de tempore, de sanctis, de communi sanctorum et de diversis. (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Post passionem ... (Act 1,3). Probatur Christi resurrectio vi probabilibus argumentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primum argumentum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (2.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Homo quidam fecit ... (Lc 14,16). In quibus verbis quinque considerari possunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo: Quis sit ille homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 16 Predigten; die \u252 \'fcbrigen Initien im Register.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Varia {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 theologica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zu folgenden Themen: de missa, de passione Christi, de rege Dario, de die iudicii, de vita monachorum, de spiritu sancto, de falsis prophetis, de sancta Anna, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de XV signis ante diem iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2, 1980, Sp. 1013-1017), de confessione (vgl. Walther, Proverbia 25431), de baptismo, de coniugio, de ordine angelorum. Teilweise in Versen: darunter Walther, Initia 1389 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 1062 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); 18330 (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Historia scholastica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], in evangelia, knappe Exzerpte: PL 198, Sp. 1616f. (Cap. 150, Add. 1), Sp. 1632 (Cap. 175, Add. 1), Sp. 1622 (Cap. 155, Add. 2), Sp. 1619 (Cap. 153, Add. 1), Sp. 1628f. (Cap. 168, Add. 1), Sp. 1628 (Cap. 166, Add. 1), Sp. 1644 (Cap. 198, Add. 1). Die \u252 \'fcbrigen Initien im Register. (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Am unteren Rand von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Petrus Lombardus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sententiarum libri quattuor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 4, dist. 24, cap. 19; dist. 8, cap. 5, Exzerpte. Ed. cit., Bd 2, S. 408 Z. 1-5 passim; S. 283 Z. 19 - S. 284 Z. 4 passim. (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 4, dist. 13, cap. 1, Exzerpt. Ed. cit., Bd 2, S. 313 Z. 16-21.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

