32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f0\fs20 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 xviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs20 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  testis iuratus dixit quod ipse erat homo de capite et corpore dicte domine\plain \f0\fs20  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Item dixit quod vidit dictum Petrum esse in possessione de predictis\plain \f0\fs20  ..., ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Petrus decessit, dimisit filium suum Odonem in Ballio domini Borbonensis\plain \f0\fs20  ..., ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dixit quod duodecim anni sunt elapsi\plain \f0\fs20  ..., ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dixit quod pater domine Borbonensis qui decessit in Cipro\plain \f0\fs20  ..., ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dixit quod quatuordecim anni sunt elapsi\plain \f0\fs20  ..., ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 apud Congnat \plain \f0\fs20 (Cognat-Lyonne, D\u233 \'e9p. Allier?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  et heredes ipsius tenuerunt\plain \f0\fs20  || ... Zu identifizieren: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs20\chcbpat7 Archambault IX.}}\plain \f0\fs20  aus dem Hause Bourbon, \u8224 \'861249 auf Zypern w\u228 \'e4hrend des 6. Kreuzzugs, und vermutlich seine j\u252 \'fcngere {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs20\chcbpat7 Tochter Agn\u232 \'e8s}}\plain \f0\fs20 , \u8224 \'861288; vgl. Jean Favier, Dictionnaire de la France m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale, Paris 1993, S. 160f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

