\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [Varia theologica]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 De beneficiis dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Vide quam magna sunt eius beneficia. Ex nihilo te creavit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 10 Punkte. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hec sunt decem beneficia. Hoc est psalterium decem cordarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quibus iugiter debemus meditari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung, beschnitten. (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes ad Christum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Salve speculum humilitatis, eximie caritatis et mansuetudinis, dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O bone Ihesu, fons vite eterne, lava pedes affectionum mearum ab omni cogitacione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et coinquinacione terreni amoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. De nativitate domini. AH 50, Nr 53 (Str. 1-7). (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Horae breves de passione Christi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Matutin - Non, bricht ab. Mit Reimgebet, auf die einzelnen Horen verteilt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Matutino tempore Christus in agone / Tristis effudit sanguinem in oracione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Partielle \u220 \'dcbereinstimmungen mit AH 30, Nr 14.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

