plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , dt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Du salt alle dyne synne beszliszen kegen vszerlicheyt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 13 Punkte. \ldblquote Gregorius Nazanzenus: De mundo corde\rdblquote  in der Bibliothek der Erfurter Kartause vorhanden, vgl. MBKD 2, S. 322 Z. 6.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Alphabetum divini amoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpte. (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tabula timoris secundum alphabetum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Alteracio et instabilitas mundi, quod homo numquam in eodem statu permanet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Xriste redemptore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 illa die. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tabula inde via purgativa et est via incipiencium secundum alphabetum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Peccator habet dolere de amicicia dei amissa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Xristi benignitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vivat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Druck: Ed. cit., Sp. 773 u. 774; s.o. 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hugo de Balma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Theologia mystica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Via illuminativa 9, Via purgativa 1-3, Exzerpte. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hugo de Palma de prima via scilicet incipiencium que dicitur purgativa. Incipit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Via purgativa respondet ordini thronorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec arena maris pre multitudine numerari potest.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: Hugues de Balma, Th\u233 \'e9ologie mystique. Introduction [...] de Francis Ruello, Introduction et apparat critiques de Jeanne Barbet, Bd 1-2 (Sources chr\u233 \'e9tiennes 408-409), Paris 1995-1996, hier 1, S. 186 Z. 5-8; S. 144-150. Vgl. Distelbrink Nr 226.
