\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  ad {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Christum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item ad dominum Ihesum sponsum anime.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Non est ita liberalis, qui se ipsum tribuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex libro contemplacionum beati Augustini.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesu nostra redempcio, amor et desiderium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 procul dubio amanda non sunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpt aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Johannes Fiscannensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Druck: PL 40, Sp. 928f. (cap. 35) = PL 158, Sp. 894f. (Oratio 17); vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 28 bzw. 62. CPPM 2, Nr 3072. Dazwischengeschoben: (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unus modus laudacionis sive exaltacionis dei valde subtilis per multa predicata in superlativo gradu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 5 Abschnitte, am Rand gez\u228 \'e4hlt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A-E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item ex libro de contemplacione beati Augustini.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amo te deus meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et da mihi effectum peticionis et desiderii mei.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Direkt angeschlossen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid preter te expectat anima mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et computabile sit ante te.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitergef\u252 \'fchrt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid enim mihi est in celo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad celestia regna volitet. Amen. Fiat voluntas tua.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mit Exzerpten aus: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Fiscannensis: Orationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Druck: PL 40, Sp. 929f. (cap. 35) u. Sp. 933 (cap. 37) = PL 158, Sp. 895-898 (Oratio 17 u. 18); und aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ecbertus Schonaugiensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Soliloquium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], cap. 9-10. Druck: PL 195, Sp. 110.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item Augustinus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O creator meus, o dominator meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Ihesu Christe, verbum patris, qui venisti in hunc mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnium sanctorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nach freier Einleitung Exzerpt aus: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Fiscannensis: Orationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Druck: PL 40, Sp. 930-932 (cap. 36) = PL 158, Sp. 891-894 (Oratio 16); vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 28 bzw. 62.}

