\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 De dominica oratione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Johannes Tauler}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Predigten}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Exzerpt, dt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De dominica oracione. Tauler.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ich saget vch in der warheyt dy got selber ist}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Ed. cit. (wie 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 101 Z. 22-26. (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hugo de Balma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Theologia mystica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Via illuminativa 46-54. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur nunc meditacio devotissima, anagogica et mistica super dominicam oracionem Hugonis de Palma Carthusiensis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 \lquote Pater\rquote . Nos pupilli sine te. \lquote Pater\rquote , id est, tu es ille qui filios spirituales progeneras}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O quando hac ardore diligam, qui et penam excuciat et a dilectione absolvat?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed. cit. (wie 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Bd 1, S. 260-268. Den einzelnen Abschnitten vor- bzw. nachgestellt \ldblquote clausulae\rdblquote  der Tabula zum Pater noster aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Alphabetum divini amoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Ed. cit., Sp. 791f. (mit Abweichungen); s.o. 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

