\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sermo}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  de theologia mystica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \u220 \'dcberschrift, ausgestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo super\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 textus beati Dyonisii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?). Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In theologia mistica per abnegacionem et ignote consurgendum ibidem declaratum littera demonstrat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed audi Hugonem de Palma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod si forte alicui legenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iterum et iterum consurgit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kompilation, \u252 \'fcberwiegend meist w\u246 \'f6rtliche Exzerpte aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hugo de Balma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Theologia mystica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Ed. cit. (wie 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), u.a. (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prologus 8, (1, S. 136 Z.16-20); Quaestio difficilis 32 (2, S. 214 Z. 4-9); (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Qu. diff. 33 (2, S. 214/216 Z. 4-16); Prol. 9 (1, S. 136/138 Z. 1-8); (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Via unitiva 1 (2, S. 8 Z. 7-17). Bemerkenswert: (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Erw\u228 \'e4hnung der Heiligen Antonius, Maria Magdalena und Maria Aegyptiaca; (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et dico cum beato Bernardo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad fratres Karthusienses de monte dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (recte: Guillaume de Saint-Thierry); (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) inseriertes Gebet: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O domine bone adolescentule}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., auch 241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

