9 \'8b. CAO Nr 4536. 6897. 6756. 7763 und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedic, domine, domum istam et omnes habitantes in illa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Vgl. Xaver Haimerl, Das Prozessionswesen des Bistums Bamberg im Mittelalter (M\u252 \'fcnchener Studien zur historischen Theologie 14), M\u252 \'fcnchen 1937 (Ndr. Hildesheim 1973), S. 67f. (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 sancti Thome}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Aquinatis] ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sertum gestans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Thoma laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Aus dem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Reimoffizium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  AH 5, Nr 84. Hymnus s.u. 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Petri martiris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sampsonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Petre martir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Aus dem Reimoffizium AH 28, Nr 48. (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die sancte {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Anne}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in prima stacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Felix vitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Nur Anfang, s.u. 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stirps\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aaron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Aus dem Reimoffizium AH 25, Nr 19. CAO Nr 6024. (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo beati {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Dominici}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  patris nostri. Ad processionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Felix vitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Panis oblatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Granum excussum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ascendenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de valle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Aus dem Reimoffizium AH 25, Nr 85. Weiteres Responsorium und Hymnus s.o. *1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In solemni recepcione conventus cantentur que notata sunt in libro cantoris cum sequenti responsorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CAO Nr 6235. (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In recepcione legatorum et prelatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CAO Nr 6289. (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u82