9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canticum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Simeonis]\u8249 \'8b. Nunc dimittis. (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Marianische Antiphon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canticum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Salve regina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Varianten f\u252 \'fcr Advent, Weihnachten und Osterzeit. (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regina celi letare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... CAO Nr 4597. 
