\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gebet nach der Kommunion}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ital. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incomincia loratione laquale si dice doppo la cominione secondo la divotione de la persona che se comunicata, laquale fece maestro Igidio di Roma, primo maestro del ordine de frati romitani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lies: eremitani) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 di sancto Augustino. Oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gratie et laude rendo atte eterno padre, omnipotente dio, elquale se (214r) degnato me misera peccatrice unire et assotiare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u220 \'dcbersetzung mit grammatisch femininen Formen von mehreren lat. Kommuniongebeten, die aneinandergereiht und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Aegidius Romanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zugeschrieben werden: (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ps.-Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio \lquote Gratias tibi ago\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio \lquote Omnipotens sempiterne deus, ecce accedo\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Schlu\u223 \'df verk\u252 \'fcrzt), (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio \lquote Sit, Jesu dulcissime\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. Opera omnia, Bd 32, Paris, Viv\u232 \'e8s 1879, S. 821f. Nr 8. 6. 7. (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio \lquote O serenissima et inclita virgo\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. Hortulus animae 1498, 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (in der Hs etwas ausf\u252 \'fchrlicher). Dasselbe Gebet auch 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

