\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Ablassgebete}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Einleitende Rubriken jeweils durchgestrichen und die Indulgenzangaben getilgt. (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Innocentius papa concessit indulgentiam quadraginta dierum et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gregorius papa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super adiunxit viginti pro qualibet vice omnibus devote dicentibus infrascripta septem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gaudia ad honorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gloriose virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gaude virgo mater Christi, quem (statt \ldblquote quae\rdblquote ) per aurem concepisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 8 Gaude-Gr\u252 \'fc\u223 \'dfe; vgl. Meersseman, Hymnos 2, S. 39f. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Deus, qui beatissimam virginem Maria (!) in conceptum et in partum virginitate servasti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Ebd., S. 207f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Papa Bonifatio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de indulgentia et perdono achi devotamente dira questa oratione quaranta di indulgentia et perdono. Oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O Maria, stella celi, scala paradisi, columpna mundi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Papa Bonifatio sexto}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de dindulgentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 due milgliaia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 danni a ciascuna persona che devota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mente dicesse questa oratione quando si leva el corpo di Christo. Oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui hanc sacratissimam carnem de gloriose virginis Marie utero assumpsisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Druck: Hortulus animae 1498, 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

