\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sententiae [de quinque septenis, de paenitenia et] de sacramentis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zusammenstellung aus verschiedenen Einzeltexten. 1. (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sentencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (folgt Rasur) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Q]uinque sunt septena: septem vicia, septem peticiones, septem dona spiritus sancti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , septem virtutes, septem beatitudines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 numquam abest ab homine.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abh\u228 \'e4ngig von: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 De quinque septenis seu septenariis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], PL 175, Sp. 405-414. Vgl. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr 4835. Unmittelbar angeschlossen: (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat7 Vis scire, homo, quanta est virtus p\u281 \'eanitenti\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 contricio sine opere, fructus sine maturitate.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beginn identisch mit: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hugo de Sancto Victore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Miscellanea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], lib. 1, tit. 105-106. PL 177, Sp. 535D-536B. Vgl. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr 6501/6502.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 2. Folgt unmittelbar: (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Tractaturus de sacramentis quatuor primum inquirenda propono}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 neque vicio levitatis fiat. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Bearbeitung einiger Abschnitte aus: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hugo de Sancto Victore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 De sacramentis christianae fidei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]; vgl. Heinrich Weisweiler, Das Schrifttum der Schule Anselms von Laon und Wilhelms von Champeaux in deutschen Bibliotheken (BGPhMA Bd 33, H. 1/2), M\u252 \'fcnster/Westf. 1936, S. 160. Beide Texte auch in den Hss {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Graz, UB, Hs 820}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  u. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Graz 2, S. 58f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 M\u252 \'fcnchen, SB, Clm 13092}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  u. 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. Hans-Georg Schmitz, Kloster Pr\u252 \'fcfening im 12. Jahrhundert (Miscellanea Bavarica Monacensia 49), M\u252 \'fcnchen 1975, S. 162; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 W\u252 \'fcrz