\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Proprium de sanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , von Vigil von Andreas (29.11.) bis Saturninus (29.11.). (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit de sancto Andrea super psalmos feriales antiphone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mox ut voce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In annunciacione BMV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von anderer Hand erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit commune sanctorum post pascha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Mit Anschlu\u223 \'df an 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Odulphi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lebuini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo sancti Liborii episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In assumpcione beate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Patris nostri Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nativitate beate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maynulphi confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lebuini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

