\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , zur Textfolge s.o.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Commune sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit commune sanctorum. De apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Antiphone et psalmos feriales, capitulum: Beatus vir ut infra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In commemoracione BMV ad vesperas antiphona per estatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ista est speciosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Formular f\u252 \'fcr die Weihnachtszeit. Dazwischengeschoben: (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  AH 51, Nr 83, auch 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

