\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gregorius episcopus etc. Rex pacificus dominus noster Ihesus Christus disposuit et previdit suos subditos ab inicio mundi esse pacificos et pudicos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Liber I: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De summa trinitate et fide katholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Firmiter (X 1.1.1). Simpliciter credendum est quod unus solus et verus est deus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dampnamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.1.2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnis, qui articulos fidei superius positi non servaverit, morte eterna dampnabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De constitutionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canonum statuta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.2.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Constitutiones canonum ab omnibus sunt servande. Nota, quod concilium Meldense precipit, quod statuta canonum custodiantur ab omnibus et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cognoscentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.2.2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Constitutio respicit tantum futura et non preterita, nisi primo de preteritis caveatur. Nota, quod leges dant formam futuris negociis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. Liber II: (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt casus 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [d]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [t]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 2.1.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Qui promisit iudicem vel iudicium non declinare, penitere non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. Liber III: (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut layci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 3.1.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Consecracionem corporis Cristi layci videre non debent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. Liber IV: (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sponsalibus et matrimonio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Francia quidam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 4.1.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Matrimonium consensu contrahitur, licet sollempnitates vel consuetudines patrie non serveventur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) ... (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5240/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Arbores consanguinitatis et affinitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s.o. (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. Liber V: (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si legitimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.1.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Infamis, periurus, criminosus accusare non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Transmisse litere continebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.40.33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus: Verbum moderacionis diminucionem continet non aucmentum. Nota, quod secundum facultates ecclesiarum canonici sunt in ecclesiis instituendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De regulis iuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (X 5.41.1-11) ...- (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Indignum est ut pro spiritualibus quis homagium compellatur facere. Nota, quod nulla pacta illicita in spiritualibus debe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t intervenire.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic sunt finiti casus quinti libri decretalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Auf die Casus folgen mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bzw. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eingeleitete Notabilia sowie zahlreiche Merkverse (s.u.). Zitiert werden: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum abbatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Bernardus de Montemirato). F\u252 \'fcr die Casus teilweise enge bis w\u246 \'f6rtliche \u220 \'dcbereinstimmung mit jenen in Hss {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Berlin, SB, Lat. fol. 167}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rose 2.2 Nr 673; nur Lib. I) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Lat. qu. 209}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rose 2.2 Nr 674); vgl. Schulte, Geschichte 2, S. 493 mit Anm. 6. 
