\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Psalterandacht am Freitag}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Psalterium istud legendum est omni feria sexta tres psalmos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sic anno evoluto persolves unum psalterium. Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Tibi ago gracias et laudes, deus meus, misericordia mea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Es folgen Ps 1-3, Magnificat (nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge) und Orationen; Initien im Register. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Sanctifica nos, domine, signaculo sancte crucis, ut fiat nobis obstaculum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CO Nr 2149; beide Gebete auch Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Karlsruhe, LB, L 106}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Karlsruhe 11, S. 257. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O beatissima anima domini nostri Ihesu (69r) Christi, sanctifica me}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut cum sanctis tuis laudem et videam te \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ihesum Christum in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Leroquais, Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 248.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

