\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Oratio ad Christum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si quis cupit obtinere in hac vita veram contricionem et omnium peccatorum remissionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicat istas oraciones subsequentes cum totidem Pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Domine Ihesu Christe, moneo te illius fletus, quem flevisti in illa die palmarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 7 Ermahnungen. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 3779.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

