\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Psalterandacht zum Heiligen Kreuz}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit psalterium de sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In honore et amore tuo, sanctissime pater, qui filium tuum misisti in terris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps 1-3. 45 mit Orationen: CO Nr 1518. 778a (nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge). Am Beginn der beiden folgenden Abschnitte je 3 Psalmen: (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In honore omnium venarum tuarum, o fili dei vivi, per quas sanguinem tuum preciosum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fundere dignatus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gloria; mit \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b und Credo, nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Deus, qui sanctam crucem ascendisti et mundi tenebras illuminasti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Auch 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (k\u252 \'fcrzere Version); vgl. Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Karlsruhe, LB, St. Blasien 77}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Karlsruhe 12, S. 57f. (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In honore passionis tue, in (99r) quo nos patibulo crucis suspensus a captivitate diaboli redemisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intercedant pro me omnes sancti, qui unquam pro Christi nomine tormenta sustinuerunt, per eundem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

