\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes de doloribus BMV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt oraciones ad beatam virginem Mariam. Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 O mater misericordie, moneo te per terriciones (215v) tui materni cordis, quando tibi Symeon nunciavit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne in nobis pereat ipsius preciosissimi sanguinis effusio. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Moneo te, mater misericordie, tristicie, quando dilectum filium tuum dominum nostrum (218v) Ihesum Christum de cruce sumebant}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi nos tui fruamur in eternum sine fine. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 2 Gebetsgruppen zu 4 und 3 Ermahnungen, jeweils mit zwischengeschalteten Versus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

