\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Capitula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , f\u252 \'fcr Vesper, Laudes und Kleine Horen. (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De tempore. (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In adventu domini ad vesperas. Capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce deus in fortitudine veniet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nocte sancte nativitatis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica prima in Xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In octava pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 che\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nocte sancte pentecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) ...\u8249 \'8b. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachpfingstzeit. (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sanctis, von Purificatio BMV (2.2.) bis Allerheiligen (1.11.). (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula per annum de sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commune sanctorum. (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De omnibus apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dedicatione templi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

