\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Collectae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Weitgehend entsprechend Weyns, Sacramentarium. (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De tempore, vom 1. Adventssonntag bis 24. Sonntag nach Trinitatis. (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica prima adventus domini collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excita domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sanctis, von Lucia (13.12.) - mit den Festen der Weihnachtsoktav - bis Damasus (11.12.). (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt collecte per annum in festis. Prima de sancta Lucia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Bemerkenswert: zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Gebete zu Petrus und Paulus (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); Kollekten f\u252 \'fcr Heiligenfeste in der Erzdi\u246 \'f6zese Trier; vgl. das Kalendarium: (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorii m.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Spoletani]\u8249 \'8b (23.12.); (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Valerii cf.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, nur Anfang; (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Castoris cf.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (13.2.); (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Symeonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Goaris cf.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paulini cf.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Materni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (14.9.); (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Severi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (22.10.); (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Materni atque Severini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (23.10.); (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Kuniberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (12.11.); \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Florini cf.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (17.11.); (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eucharij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, nur Anfang (8.12.). (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commune sanctorum. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In vigilia unius apostoli cum necesse fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dedicatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

