\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Orationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Misere (!) mei, deus, secundum magnam misericordiam tuam, quia ego super numerum maris harene peccavi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et non sum digna ad celum meos levare oculos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Responsorium aus dem Totenoffizium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Libera me, domine, de morte eterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Ottosen, Responsories, S. 399 (R 38) mit den Versikeln V 227. V 55. V 180. V 178. V 159. V 106; vgl. CAO Nr 7091.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

