um Symeonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Nunc dimittis. (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canticum Ambrosij et Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Te deum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
