\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica prima post octavam epiphanie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sabbato in vigilia pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dedicatione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. 
