\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Litania omnium sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vorangestellt: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Antiphona}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super septem psalmos in ieiunio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CAO Nr 4689. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur letania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Kyrie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salvator mundi adiuva nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Bemerkenswert: unter den M\u228 \'e4rtyrern: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ponciane, Lamberte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gereon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; unter den Bekennern: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Martine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (an 3. Stelle), ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Willibrorde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vor Benedictus), ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lebuine, Radbode, Servati, Odulphe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego dixi domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 9 Versikelpaare; es folgen 8 Kollekten: (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CO Nr 2541. 1143. (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Miserere nobis, domine, miserere nobis miseris, misericors trinitas sancta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et dimitte universa delicta nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ab omni malo preterito, presenti et futuro.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Auszug aus: PL 101, Sp. 1390 D; vgl. Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 10 mit Anm. 52. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Libera nos de morte ad vitam, de tenebris ad lucem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...- (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 orent pro nobis, ut vitam eternam habere mereamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... PL 101, Sp. 1390f. (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CO Nr 3297a/b (Variante). Nr 4620. (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, pater indul(191r)genciarum et misericordie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CO Nr 1257. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Indulgenciam et remissionem omnium peccatorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tribuat nobis omnipotens pater et misericors deus. Amen. Preciosa in conspectu domini etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

