\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Gebete zur Vorbereitung eines exorcismus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste sunt coniurationes Ptholomei ad effugandos spiritus malos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 In nomine patris ... Per invocationem et potentissimam virtutem huius sancte et individue trinitatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  munder ego indignus presbiter .N. ab omni sorde et macula peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequens oratio dicitur in aure obsessi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego .N. coniuro vos immundissimos et malignos spiritus et exorcizo vos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut veniat ad locum, ubi eum habere vis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego presbiter .N. et suffraganeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iesu Christi domini nostri vos spiritus immundos coniuro et exorcizo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut claris respondeant vocibus et non fictis adiurantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum vos adiuro et constringo in nomine dei patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Invocatio divini auxilii, ut respondeant quod clare audiantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, te humiliter et omni devotione exoro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Vgl. zu Praktiken, mit denen D\u228 \'e4monen zu einem angemessenen Verhalten gezwungen werden sollten: Franz, Benediktionen 2, S. 569f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

