\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Benedictio lactis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum quod sacerdos celebrans missa finita non lotis manibus ibit ad vasculum in quo lactis fit resolutio in butyrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adiutorium nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Vogel/Elze, PRG 1, S. 133 Nr XL/19. Es folgen weitere kurze Segensformeln. - (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1524\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedictio lactis maleficiati anno 1524\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo benedicat domum et si adest puteum hoc modo ut supra folio 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deinde legat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Exorcizo te, creatura lactis, per deum vivum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus misericordie, deus clemens, deus qui facture tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Anfang wie CO Nr 1617. (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Benediktionsformel. Abschlie\u223 \'dfend Prolog des Io-Evangeliums und Credo (nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge). - Vgl. zum Milchsegen: W.L. Braekman, Middeleeuwse witte en zwarte magie in het Nederlands taalgebied. Gecommentarieerd compendium van incantamenta tot einde 16de eeuw, Gent 1997, S. 441-454.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

