\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Coniuratio contra pythonissam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad r\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ov\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum quod ingrediendo cemiterium capiatur de terra cemiterii dicendo: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Coniuro te, o terra, ut habeas talem potestatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qualem dedit tibi deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Beschw\u246 \'f6rungsformeln}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  an 3 T\u252 \'fcren und am Hauptaltar.}

