\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Kirchenrechtliche Bestimmungen zur Klosterreform}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Innocentius III. papa.}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de statu monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum ad monasterium Sublacense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... X 3.35.6. (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Alexander III. papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que fiunt a prelato sine consilio capituli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Noverit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tue discrecionis prudencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... X 3.10.4. (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Innocentius III. papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De regularibus et transeuntibus ad religionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad apostolicam sedem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... X 3.31.16, angeschlossen: X 3.31.20. (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex concilio Lateranensi de