\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Lectionarium officii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De tempore. (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt lectiones de tempore ex integro partis estivalis. In nocte pasche sermo beati Maximi episcopi lectio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exultandum nobis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Je 12 kurze Lektionen f\u252 \'fcr die Osterzeit, je 8 f\u252 \'fcr die Nachpfingstzeit. (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt omelie dominicales. Dominica secunda post Trinitatis. Secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Lektionen IX-XII f\u252 \'fcr die Nachpfingstzeit, bis Dom. XXIV. (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Je 3 Lesungen f\u252 \'fcr die \ldblquote Noctes privatae\rdblquote . (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Anweisung und Tabelle f\u252 \'fcr die Lesungen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alicuius diei private inter festum omnium sanctorum et adventum domini.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dedicacione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. 12 Lesungen. (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Proprium de sanctis, von Ambrosius (4.4.) bis Katharina (25.11.). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ambrosii episcopi lectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctorum patrum memoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In visitacione BMV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. Mit Oktav. (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo commemoracionis beati Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag am Rand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anne vidue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lectiones, evangelium et omeliam sicut de sancta Elizabeth require infra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xcvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Vgl. Rosenthal, Martyrologium, S. 67, 85, 87. S.u. 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In assumpcione gloriose virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. Mit Oktav. (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nativitate BMV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b. Mit Oktav. Das Fest Praesentatio BMV (21.11.) ist nicht ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt; vgl. Rosenthal, ebd., S. 66. (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen: 7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat7 Evangelienperikopen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec ewangelia prescripta deficiunt in locis suis, habeatur ergo hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

